fn chktop to void
r = long 0
put gv LN 0
chk tsch numis dget r tsch2 1
gotchk tlab dget r tlabk tphys
gotchk tsta dget r tstak tnp
gotchk tnx dget r tnxk tpassv
chk tnoemu not sayemu
