fn chkcmd c long i ulong nd view uchar * res view uchar * to void
code = ulong 0
if ge i 2
code = 1
end
e = objor aget c i
put gv LN 0
lnt tcmd
lndec add i 1
lnt tisrb
lnt nd
lnb 41
